Description: xcb: Remove the obsolete Mesa threaded OpenGL check
 The Mesa threading check works around issues fixed in xcb 1.11.
 Since Qt now requires xcb 1.11, the check is no longer needed.
 .
 Remove the GLX vendor check and the Mesa version exemption. This
 also avoids disabling threaded OpenGL when the GLX client vendor
 contains "Mesa Project" but GL_VERSION has no Mesa version string.
Author: Yuanbo Chen <chenyuanbo@uniontech.com>
Origin: backport, https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtbase/+/784759
Bug: https://bugreports.qt.io/browse/QTBUG-151866
Applied-Upstream: commit:b75682ef004988d37765dee2984454e18b0a44b3
Last-Update: 2026-11-12
